          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Pressure sensitive tapes are designed to easily and safely serve a variety of needs, from sealing and packaging applications, to safety and directional indicator tapes. <strong>NADCO® Tapes & Labels, Inc.</strong> features pressure sensitive tapes in materials including paper, cloth, foils, foam, and more, all with full pressure sensitive adhesive backing for ease of application. Examples of our wide offering of products include:</p><ul><li>Masking tapes</li><li>Carton sealing tapes</li><li>Reflective tapes</li><li>Anti-slip tapes</li><li>Nuclear tapes</li><li>Autoclave tapes</li></ul><p>Our pressure sensitive tapes are suitable for applications from light-duty sealing and adhesion, up to harsh industrial environments.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
